      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Wrecking Crew have escaped with Photon through a rift in time and space. The Avengers, thanks to Thor's mystic mallet, quickly follow and find themselves in the world ruled by the thunderbolt wielding warlord known as Arkon. Meanwhile, Warbird, Iron Man, Marvel Boy, Wasp, and Goliath (Hank Pym) face off against the mechanical menace of the Doomsday Man."
